function nutritionDays(count){let days=[];for(let i=count-1;i>=0;i--){let d=shift(today(),-i),has=hasNutritionData(d),t=has?dayTotals(d):null,maintenance=maintenanceAt(d);days.push({date:d,has,totals:t,maintenance,balance:has&&maintenance!==null?t.kcal-maintenance:null})}return days}
function nutritionRangeSummary(startDate,endDate=today()){let balances=[];for(let d=startDate;d<=endDate;d=shift(d,1)){if(!hasNutritionData(d))continue;let maintenance=maintenanceAt(d);if(maintenance===null)continue;let totals=dayTotals(d);balances.push({date:d,balance:totals.kcal-maintenance,protein:totals.protein})}return {days:balances.length,balance:balances.reduce((sum,x)=>sum+x.balance,0),items:balances}}
